ile_name": "PICKABOOM Screenshot 8.png", "id": "1202494335071082", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618442_1202494338404415_1314104998578942016_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8UJuMmuVVNQQ7kNvwHeZwqM&_nc_oc=AdpQSWK8Ke1bBp9jpgJXa3dj_8X0s902ddwYPhFyxi0apLIu3pEj9tyz4zfMZi9PRjA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af38Bn3f8ZCX4zMygunvavIS7Tb3cKU8_TK5s1WNpormmg&oe=69F74248"}, {"file_name": "PICKABOOM Screenshot 9.png", "id": "1534195114587820", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617729_1534195117921153_8691084946846864449_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pTktji4Fo-gQ7kNvwFX6cnS&_nc_oc=AdqKkZW8_CGgFP9FVkTN_T4g5yzrxHE77uekM9cGv9f9HXteFUdEx870ZXhoOvneS5k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af3--08_na8gbfQusC36Ide6ZVHbN3iCQ_XZ78aNqhrhnQ&oe=69F74381"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Landscape 1 2560x1440 1.png", "id": "684914040932095", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618910_684914044265428_2959950593095626719_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=g5OltsPV3lgQ7kNvwGlyihz&_nc_oc=Adp1mNDSM7evVvX9Ft8i97y3YKxuW5qSnOhN6nQ8fc4XeFLB1IH65rKTIM5WVNMc9uo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2r3L_Uu2TkBpCX4uSiuqPY5-F2ecl7rayU8XvcWTDHuA&oe=69F7406F"}, "display_name": "PICKABOOM", "keywords": ["survival", "naturaldisasters", "funny", "horror", "adventure"], "long_description": "# **PICKABOOM**\n\n# Survive Natural Disasters. Free-to-Play. Weekly Updates. \n\nEnter the explosive world of PICKABOOM, a **multiplayer VR survival game** where every match feels like the end of the world. Team up with your squad to survive floods, quakes, and freak storms before the next cataclysm hits.\n{24914414018221905}\n{1393192055699014}\n\nVisit the **Avatar Shop**, led by VR fashion designer George Hermano, and mix survival gear with outrageous couture. Limited-time \u201cdisaster collections\u201d drop weekly so you can look iconic while the planet collapses around you.\n{698296172970507}\n{775418032145060}\n\nFace terrifyingly **unique monsters** that evolve with every environment, from crawling cave dwellers to colossal storm wraiths. No two encounters are the same.\n{1839225910314692}\n{799801039502319}\n\nWith **weekly updates**, new maps, disasters, and gear drop constantly, keeping the chaos alive. Jump into public or private lobbies, push your friends into danger, or save them just in time.\n{1287406879811240}\n\nJoin our Discord community to test new disasters, play with devs, and help shape PICKABOOM\u2019s future!\n\ud83d\udc49 https://linktr.ee/pickaboomvr\n\n**EQUIP. ADVENTURE. BOOM! PLAY PICKABOOM!** \ud83d\udca5", "short_description": "Survive Natural Disasters in VR! Free-to-Play. Weekly Updates. \n\nTeam up with your squad to survive floods, quakes, and spooky monsters before the next cataclysm hits.\n\nUse your 3D printer to craft new weapons: your own tools decide if you survive\u2026 or not!\n\nNew disasters, maps, and gear drop every week."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.pickaboomvr.com/policy-privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Unity 6.2.1f1 + MQDH", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.pickaboomvr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STAND